<title>NETHERLANDS: ABN AMRO sells 2.2 pct CMG.</title>
<headline>ABN AMRO sells 2.2 pct CMG.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN AMRO Participaties BV, a unit of ABN AMRO Holding NV, said on Friday it had sold 1,441,267 ordinary shares in CMG Plc at five pence each, representing 2.2 percent of the ordinary share capital.</p>
<p>After this sale ABN AMRO Participaties BV owns 3,311,395 ordinary shares, or 5.0 percent of CMG Plc's share capital.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
